<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Ball rating upped.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Ball rating upped.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs has raised its rating on Ball Corp to market outperform from market perform, a Goldman source said on Monday. -- Shares of the Muncie, Ind.-based packaging products and aerospace firm were trading at $26-3/8 in early Monday trade, up 37.5 cents. ((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
